From: postmarketOS <bramble@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] data: Add Google Pixel 4a (5G)

Cutout and corner radius come from the Android overlay for bramble
(config_mainBuiltInDisplayCutout: radius 40 circle at 77,77;
rounded_corner_radius: 108px). The radius is set to 128 px so Phosh keeps
the status icons a little further from the rounded corners. 1080x2340 at
413 ppi is about 66x144 mm.

---
diff --git a/data/devices/display-panels/google,bramble-sm7250.json b/data/devices/display-panels/google,bramble-sm7250.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..cd4097f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/data/devices/display-panels/google,bramble-sm7250.json
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+{
+  "name": "Google Pixel 4a (5G)",
+  "x-res": 1080,
+  "y-res": 2340,
+  "border-radius": 128,
+  "width": 66,
+  "height": 144,
+  "cutouts" : [
+    {
+      "name": "punch-hole",
+      "path": "M 37,77 a 40,40 0 1 0 80,0 a 40,40 0 1 0 -80,0 Z"
+    }
+  ]
+}
diff --git a/data/gmobile.gresources.xml b/data/gmobile.gresources.xml
index 8ff7b93..1414198 100644
--- a/data/gmobile.gresources.xml
+++ b/data/gmobile.gresources.xml
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
     <file preprocess="json-stripblanks">devices/display-panels/furilabs,flx1.json</file>
     <file preprocess="json-stripblanks">devices/display-panels/gigaset,gs5.json</file>
     <file preprocess="json-stripblanks">devices/display-panels/gigaset,gx4.json</file>
+    <file preprocess="json-stripblanks">devices/display-panels/google,bramble-sm7250.json</file>
     <file preprocess="json-stripblanks">devices/display-panels/moto,bronco.json</file>
     <file preprocess="json-stripblanks">devices/display-panels/motorola,dubai.json</file>
     <file preprocess="json-stripblanks">devices/display-panels/motorola,river.json</file>
